            "由Cayley-Hamilton，$B^2+I=0$，即$B^2=-I$。",
            "$B^4=(B^2)^2=(-I)^2=I$。直接验证：$B^2=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&0\\\\0&-1\\end{pmatrix}=-I$，与结论一致。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2019-e184f0090b-q03-practice-01",
