    },
    {
      "text": "求矩阵 $C=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$ 的特征值，说明它们是三次单位根，并求 $C^{10}$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "特征多项式",
        "单位根",
        "Cayley-Hamilton定理"
      ],
      "question_type": "单位根矩阵幂计算",
      "method": [
        "求特征多项式判断C³=I，再化简C^10"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "求特征多项式λ²+λ+1=0，说明其根为原始三次单位根，证明C³=I，用10=9+1化简"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "matrix_power_cube_root_unity",
        "template": "2×2矩阵满足λ²+λ+1=0（C³=I），求C^n",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$\\mathrm{tr}C=-1,\\det C=0\\cdot(-1)-(-1)\\cdot1=1$，特征多项式为$\\lambda^2+\\lambda+1=0$，其根满足$\\lambda^3=1,\\lambda\\neq1$（因$x^3-1=(x-1)(x^2+x+1)$），即为原始三次单位根。",
            "由Cayley-Hamilton，$C^2+C+I=0$，故$C^3-I=(C-I)(C^2+C+I)=0$，即$C^3=I$。",
            "由$10=9+1=3\\times3+1$，得$C^{10}=(C^3)^3C=I^3C=C=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2019-e184f0090b-q03-practice-02",
      "school": "大阪大学",
      "year": "2019"
    },
    {
      "text": "对角矩阵 $D=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0\\\\0&3\\end{pmatrix}$，求 $\\displaystyle\\max_{v\\neq0}\\frac{|Dv|^2}{|v|^2}$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "二次型最大值",
        "对角矩阵的特征值"
      ],
      "question_type": "基础算子范数计算",
      "method": [
        "直接分析对角矩阵作用下的比值"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "写出|Dv|²/|v|²的表达式，分析其最大值为对角元中较大者的平方"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "operator_norm_diagonal",
        "template": "diag(1,3): max(v1²+9v2²)/(v1²+v2²)",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 4,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$|Dv|^2=v_1^2+9v_2^2$，故$\\dfrac{|Dv|^2}{|v|^2}=\\dfrac{v_1^2+9v_2^2}{v_1^2+v_2^2}$。",
            "此比值是$1$与$9$的加权平均（权重为$v_1^2,v_2^2$），故其最大值为较大的权重系数$9$，在$v_1=0,v_2\\neq0$时取得。",
            "验算：取$v=(0,1)$，$|Dv|^2/|v|^2=9/1=9$；取$v=(1,0)$得$1$，故最大值确为9。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2019-e184f0090b-q03-practice-03",
      "school": "大阪大学",
      "year": "2019"
    },
    {
      "text": "求矩阵 $E=\\begin{pmatrix}2&1\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}$ 的 $E^TE$，并求 $\\displaystyle\\max_{v\\neq0}\\frac{|Ev|^2}{|v|^2}$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "对称矩阵特征值",
        "算子范数/最大奇异值平方"
      ],
      "question_type": "非对角矩阵算子范数计算",
      "method": [
        "计算E^TE并求其最大特征值"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "计算E^T，求E^TE，求特征多项式并取最大根"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "operator_norm_via_gram_matrix",
        "template": "max|Ev|²/|v|²=最大特征值 of E^TE",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$E^T=\\begin{pmatrix}2&0\\\\1&1\\end{pmatrix}$，$E^TE=\\begin{pmatrix}2&0\\\\1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2&1\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}4&2\\\\2&2\\end{pmatrix}$。",
            "$\\mathrm{tr}(E^TE)=6$，$\\det(E^TE)=(\\det E)^2=(2\\cdot1-1\\cdot0)^2=4$，特征多项式$\\mu^2-6\\mu+4=0$，解得$\\mu=3\\pm\\sqrt5$。",
            "取较大根，最大值为$3+\\sqrt5$。验算：$3+\\sqrt5\\approx5.24$，与E的元素大小(含2,1)量级相符，合理。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2019-e184f0090b-q03-practice-04",
