        "计算F^TF并求其最大特征值"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "matrix_power_and_operator_norm",
        "template": "2×2矩阵F满足λ²+1=0，求F^7及max|Fv|²/|v|²",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "F^7",
          "steps": [
            "$\\mathrm{tr}F=1+(-1)=0$，$\\det F=1\\cdot(-1)-1\\cdot(-2)=-1+2=1$，特征多项式为$\\lambda^2+1=0$。",
            "由Cayley-Hamilton，$F^2+I=0$，即$F^2=-I$；从而$F^4=(F^2)^2=I$。",
            "$F^7=F^4\\cdot F^2\\cdot F=I\\cdot(-I)\\cdot F=-F=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&-1\\\\2&1\\end{pmatrix}$。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "max|Fv|²/|v|²",
          "steps": [
            "$F^T=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-2\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$，$F^TF=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-2\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\-2&-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}5&3\\\\3&2\\end{pmatrix}$。",
            "$\\mathrm{tr}(F^TF)=7$，$\\det(F^TF)=(\\det F)^2=1$，特征多项式$\\mu^2-7\\mu+1=0$，解得$\\mu=\\dfrac{7\\pm\\sqrt{45}}{2}=\\dfrac{7\\pm3\\sqrt5}{2}$。",
            "取较大根，最大值为$\\dfrac{7+3\\sqrt5}{2}$。验算：数值约为$(7+6.7)/2\\approx6.85$，与矩阵元素量级相符。"
          ]
        }
